{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first person action game, you need fight with enemy to escape from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yang Jingyuan is a great fighter who is master of laws, politics, psychology, even if she's young and is still a student in college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today you're lucky and chosen by her as her opponent, can you win her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting with the great fighter Yang Jingyuan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your pressure to avoid failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are itchy, and you need itching, but DONT let her see you itching, she will be VERY ANGRY, and you will get SEVERE PUNISHMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a first person action game fighting with enemy to escape from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941720?t=1770617672","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941720?t=1770617672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941720/4e02b42ccbd98f7846059b4bfd38f8d552215a3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770617672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941720/4e02b42ccbd98f7846059b4bfd38f8d552215a3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770617672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first person action game, you need fight with enemy to escape from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yang Jingyuan is a great